              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, ĩtina wa kũmũthika, aneena na ana make, akĩmea, Nakw’a, mwĩnthika nyie ngunganĩ vala vathikawa akw’ũ vala mũndũ wa Ngai ũthikĩtwe; mwĩia mavĩndĩ makwa ũtee wa mavĩndĩ make. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.31"
            ]
          }
